  "worked_solution": "Multiplying a purely imaginary number by a real number is similar to multiplying two monomials.\n\nFor the given problem, we have\n\n$$\n6\\,\\text{i}\\cdot (-3)=(6\\cdot (-3))\\,\\text{i}=-18\\,\\text{i}.\n$$",
